{"2000980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maku", "steam_appid": 2000980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2612280, 4146940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the swarm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maku is a bullet hell survival experience where anyone can pick up and play. Delve into various worlds to fight your way through thousands of monsters and grow in power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/bacdc9b50d7e9a38f88a3cd75ad4868a.poster.avif?t=1782673808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/bacdc9b50d7e9a38f88a3cd75ad4868a.webm?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/bacdc9b50d7e9a38f88a3cd75ad4868a.mp4?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inverted Bullet Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive movement-focused controls allow you to focus on dodging and weaving through your enemies while you fire your weapons at the swarm. Coordinate your positioning to align with your firing patterns and timing to maximize your damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/ccf66199a140156938bfee19c905589e.poster.avif?t=1782673808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/ccf66199a140156938bfee19c905589e.webm?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/ccf66199a140156938bfee19c905589e.mp4?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain new weapons and upgrades to create powerful builds and experiment with diverse synergies in order to defeat the world boss before time runs out. Collect coins along the way to unlock permanent upgrades and improve your future runs. Defeat bosses and complete challenges to unlock characters for your roster and progress to new worlds with increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increasingly Difficult Challenges!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and challenges to unlock the skill-testing challenge modes, <strong>Hardcore</strong> and <strong>Demon</strong> mode. Alter your experience with the <strong>Endless</strong> and <strong>Turbo</strong> modes. See how long you can survive and farm permanent upgrades in <strong>Endless</strong> mode. Shorten run times and test your reflexes with <strong>Turbo</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maku is a solo project that does not use any AI assets.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the swarm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maku is a bullet hell survival experience where anyone can pick up and play. Delve into various worlds to fight your way through thousands of monsters and grow in power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/bacdc9b50d7e9a38f88a3cd75ad4868a.poster.avif?t=1782673808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/bacdc9b50d7e9a38f88a3cd75ad4868a.webm?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/bacdc9b50d7e9a38f88a3cd75ad4868a.mp4?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inverted Bullet Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive movement-focused controls allow you to focus on dodging and weaving through your enemies while you fire your weapons at the swarm. Coordinate your positioning to align with your firing patterns and timing to maximize your damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/ccf66199a140156938bfee19c905589e.poster.avif?t=1782673808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/ccf66199a140156938bfee19c905589e.webm?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/extras/ccf66199a140156938bfee19c905589e.mp4?t=1782673808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-Up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain new weapons and upgrades to create powerful builds and experiment with diverse synergies in order to defeat the world boss before time runs out. Collect coins along the way to unlock permanent upgrades and improve your future runs. Defeat bosses and complete challenges to unlock characters for your roster and progress to new worlds with increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increasingly Difficult Challenges!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and challenges to unlock the skill-testing challenge modes, <strong>Hardcore</strong> and <strong>Demon</strong> mode. Alter your experience with the <strong>Endless</strong> and <strong>Turbo</strong> modes. See how long you can survive and farm permanent upgrades in <strong>Endless</strong> mode. Shorten run times and test your reflexes with <strong>Turbo</strong> mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maku is a solo project that does not use any AI assets.</p>", "short_description": "Battle and survive through an endless swarm of monsters! Maku is a bullet hell survival game where you power-up your character with weapons and upgrades to defeat increasingly stronger enemies that await you!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/header.jpg?t=1782673808", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782673808", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782673808", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Duo Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9 Capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 7.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9 Capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2026 Aizen McQuaid / Whelp. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaku<br />\r\n